{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"cuimao-e-o039","title":"桓阶、和洽进言救毛玠，玠遂免黜","accounts":[{"id":"cuimao-a-8fc7b28acb11897bbe09","label":"正文","text":"桓阶、和洽进言救毛玠，玠遂免黜","evidence":["cuimao-q-a9104d6ad32d7e7c2dc6"]},{"id":"hechang-a-4919ce2a81c8b4059ab8","label":"正文","text":"和洽反复请核毛玠案","evidence":["hechang-q-e718a6e06d9ecd9aab9e","hechang-q-a6153efd00a429c80c1b","hechang-q-47a228c44b2ba9746217"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0395","role":"进言救玠者","evidence":["cuimao-q-a9104d6ad32d7e7c2dc6"]},{"person":"wudi-p0325","role":"进言救玠者","evidence":["cuimao-q-a9104d6ad32d7e7c2dc6"]},{"person":"wudi-p0301","role":"被救而免黜者","evidence":["cuimao-q-a9104d6ad32d7e7c2dc6"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"答谏","evidence":["hechang-q-e718a6e06d9ecd9aab9e","hechang-q-a6153efd00a429c80c1b","hechang-q-47a228c44b2ba9746217"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["cuimao-q-a9104d6ad32d7e7c2dc6"]},"ordering_evidence":"cuimao-q-a9104d6ad32d7e7c2dc6","source_order":[12,138,0],"order":2764}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0301","name":"毛玠","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0325","name":"和洽","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0395","name":"桓阶","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"cuimao-q-a9104d6ad32d7e7c2dc6","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-a2a5937f000469042d73","layer":"original","quote":"时桓阶、和洽进言救玠〖45〗，玠遂免黜","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":19},{"id":"hechang-q-47a228c44b2ba9746217","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-4eae1aa6eaf8dd106a16","layer":"original","quote":"太祖曰：“所以不考，欲两全玠及言事者耳。”洽对曰：“玠信有谤主之言〖27〗，当肆之市朝〖28〗；若玠无此，言事者加诬大臣以误主听。二者不加检核，臣窃不安。”太祖曰：“方有军事，安可受人言便考之邪〖29〗？狐射姑刺阳处父于朝〖30〗，此为君之诫也〖31〗。”","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":128},{"id":"hechang-q-a6153efd00a429c80c1b","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-09ea6e777225a545c40c","layer":"original","quote":"洽对曰：“如言事者言，玠罪过深重，非天地所覆载；臣非敢曲理玠以枉大伦也〖19〗。以玠出群吏之中，特见拔擢，显在首职〖20〗；历年荷宠〖21〗，刚直忠公，为众所惮：不宜有此。然人情难保，要宜考核〖22〗，两验其实〖23〗。今圣恩垂含垢之仁〖24〗，不忍致之于理〖25〗；更使曲直之分不明，疑自近始〖26〗。”","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":16,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":153},{"id":"hechang-q-e718a6e06d9ecd9aab9e","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-348784738957769cd51f","layer":"original","quote":"魏国既建，为侍中。后有白毛玠谤毁太祖；太祖见近臣，怒甚。洽陈玠素行有本，求案实其事〖13〗。罢朝，太祖令曰；“今言事者白玠不但谤吾也，乃复为崔琰觖望〖14〗。此损君臣恩义，妄为死友怨叹〖15〗，殆不可忍也。昔萧、曹与高祖并起微贱〖16〗，致功立勋。高祖每在屈笮〖17〗，二相恭顺，臣道益彰，所以祚及后世也。和侍中比求实之，所以不听，欲重参之耳〖18〗。”","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":15,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":177}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
